WEBVTT

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:16.780
You, do it!

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:29.030
I recommend this area.

00:00:29.030 --> 00:00:33.050
Vegetables of the season are inexpensive, delicious and nutritious.

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:47.690
It seems that he's become quite reliable.

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:51.530
Ren, from tomorrow on you are to be my personal steward for a while.

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:54.010
Just like Onee-chan!

00:00:54.010 --> 00:00:56.700
Start off by keeping track of my schedule.

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:59.030
Yes. By the way, what is your schedule for tomorrow?

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:00.990
Guarding the house.

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:03.460
Guarding the house, huh.

00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:04.670
What else?

00:01:04.670 --> 00:01:05.970
That's all.

00:01:08.590 --> 00:01:12.500
What does Miyu-san do everyday?

00:02:57.480 --> 00:02:59.250
Good morning.

00:03:02.520 --> 00:03:03.200
Morning.

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:06.080
M-Miyu-san?

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:13.220
Here.

00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:17.740
You should wear this bra today.

00:03:17.740 --> 00:03:19.450
You're tickling me.

00:03:19.450 --> 00:03:22.000
Such cute cherries!

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:22.010
Cherries?

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:25.550
Come on, Miyu-chan, banzai!

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:30.060
Mihato, how many times do I have to tell you not to treat me like a child!

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:30.800
Banzai.

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:31.940
Yes, yes.

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:39.230
Whoa...

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:40.760
Ren, is something the matter?

00:03:40.760 --> 00:03:43.000
Huh? Oh, well...

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:45.990
I was just admiring the nice combination you two make.

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:48.390
Mihato is very attentive which helps me greatly.

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:54.130
Miyu-chan is so sweet and cute, it's worth serving you.

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:57.040
Not cute, but full of adult charm.

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:59.330
There, it's done.

00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:03.800
I'm perfect today, as always.

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:07.610
I'm on my way!

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:11.010
Have a nice day, Yume.

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:15.730
Miyu-tan, be a good girl and take care of the house.

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:16.730
Nee-san...

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:20.230
Shinra-sama, it's time to go.

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:23.190
Right, I'm off to my battlefield.

00:04:23.190 --> 00:04:25.240
I will accompany you to the front door.

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:30.950
Here is your after-meal coffee.

00:04:31.350 --> 00:04:33.660
My, it's served black, befitting the adult person I am.

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:36.580
Ren, you've become quite attentive yourself.

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:39.290
Oh, thank you very much.

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:43.690
What is today's schedule?

00:04:43.690 --> 00:04:46.220
Guarding the house.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:06.070
Miyu-san didn't go outside at all.

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:08.770
Ren, you must get ready yourself.

00:05:08.770 --> 00:05:09.570
Yes.

00:05:10.060 --> 00:05:11.780
And what must I get ready for...

00:05:14.240 --> 00:05:15.750
My bath.

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.760
Huh? What? That is.. um... er...

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:21.890
Huh? W-What is this?

00:05:21.890 --> 00:05:23.130
Wash it for me.

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:24.130
Yes.

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:27.860
Lingeries are made of delicate fabrics, so you must hand wash it, okay?

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:29.640
Yes, very well!

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:39.250
H-How is my stroke?

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:42.000
Yes, it's nice and soft.

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:48.610
Being master and servant, you mustn't feel embarrassed in front of me.

00:05:49.050 --> 00:05:51.870
From tomorrow, properly execute your duties.

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:52.660
Yes.

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:55.410
Then, good night.

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:56.710
Good night, Ren.

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:07.470
Having an innocent boy attend to me isn't bad after all.

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:15.520
Let's see... tomorrow's schedule.

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:24.360
My, my... your uniform will get all wrinkled.

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:39.430
Let's provide our services again tomorrow.

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:50.520
Good morning, Miyu-san.

00:06:50.520 --> 00:06:51.300
Morning.

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:05.000
What's the schedule for today?

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:07.820
Gathering information over the internet.

00:07:33.130 --> 00:07:36.480
I was able to wash her back without feeling embarrassed today.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:38.640
Huh?

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:43.280
Ren, call Mihato over.

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:44.020
Huh?

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:47.820
Let's have a talk and strengthen the bond between master and servant.

00:07:52.670 --> 00:07:54.320
I've always wanted to do this.

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:59.270
I'd feel bad if Mihato's arm became numb, so I'll test in on you, Ren.

00:07:59.270 --> 00:08:00.390
Oh...

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:02.710
Ren-chan...

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:07.790
Since Mihato fell asleep, tell me about you, Ren.

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:09.530
What should I talk about?

00:08:09.530 --> 00:08:13.430
My story until I came here isn't anything pleasant to hear about.

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:15.530
Oh, right.

00:08:15.530 --> 00:08:17.220
Then, what is your dream?

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:19.020
My dream is...

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:21.470
Is to live happily with Hato-nee.

00:08:21.470 --> 00:08:23.380
In that case, rest assured.

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:27.770
As long as you serve me, I'll take good care of you two.

00:08:28.720 --> 00:08:30.280
Thank you very much.

00:08:35.380 --> 00:08:36.970
She may not look it, but...

00:08:37.490 --> 00:08:40.200
...Miyu-san is truly an adult.

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:44.210
And what is your dream, Miyu-san?

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:57.220
I-I can't sleep...

00:09:06.240 --> 00:09:08.320
She's bare naked...

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:23.230
My, my...

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:26.750
What are you up to Ren-chan?

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:29.010
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:30.790
The devil made me do it!

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:33.300
Oh, the devil made you do it?

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:36.000
Then, I guess it can't be helped, you naughty boy.

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:42.310
If you think you can get away like that, what's the use of having laws, huh?

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:44.350
Shame on you, Ren.

00:09:49.800 --> 00:09:51.440
I'll be on my way.

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:53.440
Yume, is anything wrong?

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:55.120
No, it's just that...

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:58.500
The assignment I have to submit today isn't finished yet.

00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:00.430
If it's about homework, I'll look over it.

00:10:00.430 --> 00:10:03.870
Thanks, but I'll take care of it at school.

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:07.660
Can you suddenly do something you couldn't until now?

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:10.630
That's too straightforward of a comment...

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:16.500
What's with you, Miyu-tan, acting like a big sister from the morning?

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:18.410
Stop saying odd things!

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:21.180
No matter how smart you are, you're still my little sister.

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:24.060
Be respectful of your older sister and depend on me.

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:28.060
Nee-san, you're the one who should act like and elder and control yourself.

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:29.590
I'll be going.

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:37.530
Shinra-sama, it's time.

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:39.780
Right.

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:44.790
What's the schedule for today?

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:47.500
Revitalizing your energy in the house.

00:10:58.260 --> 00:11:01.980
I wonder how long Miyu-san is going to idle away like this?

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:05.970
I can't get enough of your figure!

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:03.990
Huh?

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:10.230
Hey baby, come with me!

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:14.820
Your body is  honest. You're getting hot!

00:11:16.720 --> 00:11:19.570
You moan with a great voice. Did you come already?

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:21.360
Disciplinary measures!

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:25.730
Cut it out! You're going to make the rice taste bad!

00:11:26.250 --> 00:11:31.330
You plebeian! How dare a serf like you infringe upon my privacy!

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:34.000
You're so full of flaws, I don't know where to start!

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:36.270
In any case, serfs have nothing to do with this!

00:11:36.270 --> 00:11:40.750
If you're going to be Miyu's exclusive, then you're my subordinate!

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:44.010
Go find a hot chick for me!

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:45.090
What did you say? Screw yourself!

00:11:45.520 --> 00:11:47.000
You third-rate perverted robot!

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:50.520
I'll let you off with your cell phone!

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:52.560
What are you going to do to my cell phone?

00:11:53.490 --> 00:11:56.060
Do you insist on arguing with me?

00:11:56.060 --> 00:11:57.680
W-What should we do, Beni?

00:11:57.680 --> 00:11:58.940
Should we stop them?

00:11:58.940 --> 00:12:00.880
Don't get involved with these idiots.

00:12:01.460 --> 00:12:02.530
Wait!

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:05.530
Hold it, you yellow piece of junk!

00:12:05.980 --> 00:12:07.610
In your dreams!

00:12:07.610 --> 00:12:09.120
Damn, wait up!

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:13.080
That goddamned Benisu squealed on us.

00:12:13.610 --> 00:12:16.720
How dare you bring shame upon your master.

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:19.750
You two are in for some punishment!

00:12:23.460 --> 00:12:27.970
You...

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:32.020
I'm going to make you into Miyumiyu!

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:32.020
Translator's note: Parody of Hatsune Miku, the vocaloid character who likes leeks known for her trademark line: "I'm going to make you into Mikkumiku!"

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:36.420
Sigh, I'm becoming more and more uncertain about Miyu-san.

00:12:49.690 --> 00:12:51.370
This is all your fault!

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:53.880
I'm...

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:57.490
H-Hey, what's the matter?

00:12:58.040 --> 00:12:59.500
Are you out of batteries?

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:01.340
Hold it right there!

00:13:08.790 --> 00:13:11.640
Miyu, I won't do it anymore, so forgive me!

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:14.130
That was taken care of while you were being recharged.

00:13:14.130 --> 00:13:15.480
What did you say?

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:23.750
My soul mate! Thanks for saving me!

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:26.300
So you were a good guy after all.

00:13:26.300 --> 00:13:28.780
If you have any trouble, just let me know.

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:31.750
Since we're friends now!

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:33.910
Translator's note: Reference to the good-natured Jaian in the Doraemon movies, voiced by Tatekabe Kazuya unlike his TV anime counterpart, the VA for De Niro.

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:33.910
You're really a weird robot.

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:40.190
Just now, a money transfer was made into Miyu's account.

00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:43.750
Huh? Although all she does is hang around the house she has income?

00:13:43.750 --> 00:13:46.090
Don't underestimate Miyu.

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:51.560
She has patents for numerous inventions, so she earns money without having to work.

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:54.900
Miyu studied hard from childhood,

00:13:54.900 --> 00:14:00.600
where she skipped grades and graduated from college early, growing up at more than twice the speed of ordinary people.

00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:02.200
I see...

00:14:02.740 --> 00:14:05.400
Miyu-san wasn't simply loafing around.

00:14:07.060 --> 00:14:09.860
Miyu-san... um... just right now... I...

00:14:09.860 --> 00:14:12.150
You just came at the right time.

00:14:12.150 --> 00:14:13.370
Lend us a hand.

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:14.950
Huh? S-Sure.

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:16.750
Come on, move it.

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:18.830
You're only going to get in the way standing there.

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:22.080
Here, Mihato, put this in the oven.

00:14:22.080 --> 00:14:23.250
Sure thing.

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:24.590
Poing!

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:27.080
Translator's note: Trademark line of Boyakkii from Yatterman, used when depressing buttons to activate machines.

00:14:27.080 --> 00:14:29.620
What are you doing you scumbags!

00:14:27.080 --> 00:14:31.080
Translator's note: Line of Doronjo from Yatterman.

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:32.460
If you don't hurry up, it's punishment time!

00:14:32.460 --> 00:14:34.470
Arahorasassa!

00:14:32.460 --> 00:14:34.470
Translator's note: "Aye aye, ma'am", the trademark line of Boyakkii and Tonzuraa from Yatterman, the latter voiced by Tatekabe Kazuya, the VA for De Niro.

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:38.000
Sigh, what should I do?

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:40.480
You weren't able to submit your career option form?

00:14:40.910 --> 00:14:41.710
Yup.

00:14:42.280 --> 00:14:46.070
To have a name like Yume and not have a dream is a blemish to my namesake.

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:47.570
Yume...

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:52.430
Well, compared to global warming issues, it's a trivial matter, right?

00:14:53.270 --> 00:14:57.160
If you try to escape from reality like that, nothing will change.

00:14:57.530 --> 00:15:00.210
I see. Then, what should I do?

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:01.920
Yume, you must think about that yourself.

00:15:02.470 --> 00:15:03.620
You're right.

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:05.850
Um...

00:15:05.850 --> 00:15:08.130
Yume, never give up!

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:14.320
Here is your coffee.

00:15:14.320 --> 00:15:15.640
Oh, it's Shinra-sama.

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:18.960
Your father, Mr. Kuonji Banshou, is not only a renowned businessman...

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:24.560
...he is famous for his environmental protection and charity efforts.

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:26.010
How do you feel about him?

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:30.940
My father is one of the people I respect the most.

00:15:31.510 --> 00:15:32.860
I'm envious.

00:15:34.150 --> 00:15:36.530
For a father to be respected like that.

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:38.450
Ren...

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:44.880
Are you going to expand in such fields in addition to your musical activities, Shinra-san?

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:50.130
Yes, however, I will focus my attention on music for now.

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:54.910
This concludes our interview with Kuonji Shinra-san, classical music's idol conductor,

00:15:54.910 --> 00:15:57.000
who will lead the Nanahama Philharmonic Orchestra for their coming up regularly scheduled concert.

00:15:57.000 --> 00:15:58.520
Is it because she's on the job?

00:15:58.520 --> 00:16:02.490
She wasn't just serious, she didn't even crack a smile.

00:16:02.490 --> 00:16:07.310
She's probably upset that the host only asked about her father.

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:10.320
Classic Shinra-sama!

00:16:13.220 --> 00:16:15.000
Although the concert is coming up,

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:18.830
why don't you take a vacation, as you have been giving many interviews recently?

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:21.670
I'm all right.

00:16:31.860 --> 00:16:35.050
Tou-sama was really a wonderful person.

00:16:38.660 --> 00:16:40.560
At least the music is good.

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:41.790
Flying squirrel!

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:42.870
You're in the way!

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:45.190
I lost ten life points!

00:16:44.590 --> 00:16:46.560
Is this flying squirrel friend or foe?

00:16:47.030 --> 00:16:48.650
I can't tell it apart!

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:51.040
You might as well choose that red door.

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:52.570
It's such a lovely game.

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:54.040
Translator's note: These video game sequences come from the Sega Dreamcast game Death Crimson 2.

00:16:54.480 --> 00:16:55.960
You guys!

00:16:55.960 --> 00:16:58.910
Are you seriously thinking about your future?

00:17:01.530 --> 00:17:03.580
My dream hasn't changed.

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:04.910
For now, don't tell me what to do!

00:17:07.020 --> 00:17:10.500
Here are living expenses for this month. Any complaints?

00:17:12.020 --> 00:17:12.820
Get out of the way!

00:17:16.040 --> 00:17:18.020
What's with her attitude?

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:20.720
Um, Shin Onee-chan...

00:17:21.190 --> 00:17:25.100
Yume is thinking of getting a part time job and find out what I'm suited for.

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:29.010
Miyu became a delinquent...

00:17:30.010 --> 00:17:33.440
Now now, I wonder how she'll turn out if she does become one.

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:37.150
Maybe something like this.

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:43.120
Once again, Yume was the idol of the academy today.

00:17:43.780 --> 00:17:46.430
You're so lucky, Yume.

00:17:46.430 --> 00:17:47.910
W-What has gotten into you?

00:17:47.910 --> 00:17:51.670
The smart Onee-chan, once called a child prodigy, to be doing things like that.

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:56.180
I'm not smart and a prodigy any more, Yume.

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:01.500
You know, I'm just a...

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:03.680
Onee-chan...

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:09.690
Yume, come with me and let's fall to the darkest pits of hell.

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:15.150
First of all, rip the shrink wrap and read books for free.

00:18:16.390 --> 00:18:19.820
Then you whisper out to kids, "Santa doesn't exist."

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:26.940
When you're standing in line and the shopper in front of you takes time to hand out the coins, you go...

00:18:30.780 --> 00:18:36.420
Finally, when you're about to lose at an online game, you disconnect the line.

00:18:38.810 --> 00:18:40.850
It's probably something like that...

00:18:41.810 --> 00:18:44.190
Oh, no...

00:18:44.190 --> 00:18:47.000
Weren't you subtly including your personal desires?

00:18:47.510 --> 00:18:50.440
Miyu-san is a person who's quite footloose and fancy-free.

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:52.810
She might be making music incognito.

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:55.150
Something like this.

00:18:56.640 --> 00:19:00.350
Hey bastards, glad you could make it to my live stage!

00:19:00.350 --> 00:19:01.850
Whoa, it's Miyu-san!

00:19:01.850 --> 00:19:04.030
Her twin tail sure rocks!

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:05.540
Here goes the first song.

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:08.460
"Death Twin Tails," take this!

00:19:08.460 --> 00:19:12.030
Twin twin twin twin twin twin twin twin twin twin...

00:19:12.030 --> 00:19:15.810
All right! Miyu-san's, blurt out "twin" ten times in two seconds!

00:19:12.030 --> 00:19:18.380
Translator's note: Parody of Johannes Krauser II from the manga Detroit Metal City.

00:19:15.810 --> 00:19:18.380
It's as if I had twin tails!

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:24.740
Twin tails forever!

00:19:28.170 --> 00:19:30.940
The next song is "IQ 240", here we go!

00:19:32.300 --> 00:19:36.500
Yes, it's Miyu-san's specialty, "IQ 240"!

00:19:47.090 --> 00:19:48.910
Buy the CD to hear the rest!

00:19:49.400 --> 00:19:50.600
Something like that.

00:19:50.600 --> 00:19:52.010
Why death metal?

00:19:52.510 --> 00:19:53.790
I bet it's your taste.

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:59.090
In any case, I will never allow her to become a delinquent!

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:02.010
I have to comfort Miyu-tan and persuade her.

00:20:02.610 --> 00:20:03.800
Please wait.

00:20:04.130 --> 00:20:05.650
Don't get in the way, Ren!

00:20:05.650 --> 00:20:10.500
Since it must have been so tough for Miyu-san until now, she's simply taking a break.

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:11.680
A break?

00:20:11.680 --> 00:20:15.150
It's not that she's doing nothing.

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:19.980
Miyu-san is admired by all of the staff, and not just by her personal attendants.

00:20:20.520 --> 00:20:25.250
Besides, isn't Miyu-san the one most knowledgeable about household issues?

00:20:27.270 --> 00:20:29.490
Please take a close look at Miyu-san's present behavior!

00:20:39.760 --> 00:20:42.460
It looks like I was getting too impatient.

00:20:43.330 --> 00:20:44.410
And?

00:20:45.270 --> 00:20:48.470
As your sister, I won't make the same mistake.

00:20:50.650 --> 00:20:54.770
Then, as a token of your apology, I'll make you wear shorts.

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:57.270
Don't get carried away, you loli!

00:20:57.720 --> 00:20:58.670
Nee-san!

00:21:01.390 --> 00:21:02.420
Stop it!

00:21:06.210 --> 00:21:08.010
This is my dream.

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:14.070
To be able to enjoy fun times together with people who are important to me.

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:09.750
Say ah!

00:21:14.470 --> 00:21:20.640
To become an entrepreneur of a restaurant, where friends and family can casually stop by.

00:21:21.260 --> 00:21:22.830
That's a wonderful dream.

00:21:25.020 --> 00:21:27.380
Then, Yume will also make an announcement!

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:30.550
Yume is going to do part time work!

00:21:31.320 --> 00:21:32.760
Oh, work hard then.

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:40.750
By the way, Miyu-tan, even if you start a business, you better be home when I want to see you.

00:21:40.750 --> 00:21:42.860
You're starting to contradict yourself!

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:46.100
Love is a selfish thing, you know!

00:21:43.680 --> 00:21:47.870
Hey... come on... Ren, come to my aid!

00:21:47.870 --> 00:21:48.980
Yes, I'll save you!

00:21:48.980 --> 00:21:51.050
And who is the master of this house, Ren?

00:21:51.050 --> 00:21:51.770
I won't save you!

00:21:51.280 --> 00:21:53.190
But, he's now my exclusive!

00:21:52.520 --> 00:21:53.580
I'll save you!

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:58.000
Ren, as you're now my exclusive, you better help me...

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:55.200
That has nothing to do with it!

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:55.200
Huh? That is...

00:21:57.720 --> 00:22:00.830
What the master owns is the master's, what her sister owns is also the master's.

00:22:00.830 --> 00:22:01.390
Shut up!

00:22:01.390 --> 00:22:02.660
Let's eat!

00:22:02.660 --> 00:22:03.990
Didn't you know that?

00:22:03.340 --> 00:22:03.990
Ren!

00:22:04.400 --> 00:22:06.850
Hey, somebody save me!

00:22:22.580 --> 00:22:23.100
Yume?

00:22:30.450 --> 00:22:34.000
Why? Why only Miyu Onee-chan?

00:22:34.570 --> 00:22:35.730
Don't cry.

00:24:11.600 --> 00:24:13.000
Sigh... blue...

00:24:13.000 --> 00:24:14.190
Yume is distressed.

00:24:14.190 --> 00:24:16.610
As her servant and friend, I must go to her aid!

00:24:16.610 --> 00:24:18.740
Help me, my prince on a wooden pony!

00:24:18.740 --> 00:24:20.410
I think she's requesting for a white horse.

00:24:20.410 --> 00:24:23.230
Of course I can ride it. I was known as "rider" back home, you know!

00:24:20.410 --> 00:24:24.890
Translator's note: Reference to Rider from Fate/stay night,
voiced by Asakawa Yuu, the VA for Natose.

00:24:23.230 --> 00:24:24.260
Leave it to me!
